  "public_instruction": "Swap the tableware items between the dusty kitchen island (ketchup bottle and coffee mug) and the dusty dining table (bowl and teapot): each surface must hold no tableware items when wiped with the cleaning cloth, and must be wiped clean before receiving the incoming items; leave the nearby small coffee table empty of tableware at completion, return the cleaning cloth to the kitchen sink, leave the wooden tray on a table or counter, and finish empty-handed.",
  "public_context": [
    "Wipe all dust off the kitchen island using the cleaning cloth and place the bowl and teapot from the dining table onto the clean kitchen island. Rules: the kitchen island must have no tableware items on it when wiped, and must be wiped clean before receiving the bowl or teapot.",
    "Wipe all dust off the dining table using the cleaning cloth and deliver the ketchup bottle and coffee mug from the kitchen island to the clean dining table. Rules: the dining table must have no tableware items on it when wiped, and must be wiped clean before receiving the ketchup bottle or coffee mug.",
    "Ensure the small coffee table beside the kitchen island holds no tableware items at completion, return the cleaning cloth to the kitchen sink, and leave the wooden tray resting on the kitchen island, small coffee table, or dining table.",
    "Finish with no object held."
  ],
